	)
	(text "PCM3060 in hardware-control mode: MODE 220 kΩ to DGND = parallel control with differential outputs;\nFMT low = 24-bit I2S, IFMD low = ADC and DAC both slaves, DEMP low = no de-emphasis. One I2S bus\nfeeds both halves (SCKI1/2, BCK1/2, LRCK1/2 joined). RST is pulled up, so the codec starts by itself\n1024 clocks after power-up. ADC full scale 0.6 × VCC = 3 Vpp around VCOM; DAC 8 Vpp differential."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.5 1.5))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7b2fde1c-eb63-548a-ab90-661a502023bb")
	)
